	\L_024ae:
	\L_023ea:
	ZH 1:
	'Con đẹp lắm, Amiran...'
	\L_0250f:
	\L_02502:
	\L_0245a:
	ZH 1:
	'Amiran: Cha... Lelyukov: Giá'
